From e8deac5b0bf296137bc6f36011e976e5ffd1a645 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:00:59 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 50/60] Muse Spark: the prompt path (TF_MUSE_PROMPT=1): prompt
 chunks as wide windows, experts in 512-row grouped windows, the head on the
 last row; bit-exact with decode rows; Op.prompt on the plan link, tf-muse
 prompt check

